OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANorway and Finland leaders hold rare
OL,4,Acall with Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the call, Putin said
OL,7,F"confrontational" EU and Nato policies
OL,8,Fwere prolonging the war which began
OL,9,Fwhen Russia launched a full-scale
OL,10,Finvasion in 2022.
OL,12,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,13,Fhas spoken to the two Nordic leaders
OL,14,Fafter their conversation with Putin.
OL,15,FLast week, Zelensky met them as well as
OL,16,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff in Oslo.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
